    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's a pretty heavy topic. some people argue that even if tests aren't perfect, they're still the best tool we have for keeping things objective and making sure talent gets recognized regardless of who someone is. how would you respond to someone saying that standardized tests are actually an essential tool for fairness?",
