    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that. but i feel like if we just ditch testing entirely, we're just left with totally subjective decisions. wouldn't that just mean hiring and admissions end up being based on vibes or even more nepotism? isn't there a way to actually make it objective like the proponents say?",
